Marvel Studios president Kevin Feige and co-directors Anthony and Joe Russo are getting candid about filming &#x201C; Avengers: Doomsday &#x201D; with the late star Patrick Stewart , whose role became his final on-screen appearance after his death in October.

&#x201C;He stood up and he gave a speech to the crew,&#x201D; Feige told Entertainment Weekly of Stewart's final day shooting. &#x201C;We didn&#x2019;t know necessarily it would be his last day on a set, but he was sort of indicating to us that he thought it was.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories 'Hold Onto Me' Director Myrsini Aristidou Kicks Off Historic Oscar Campaign for Sundance Audience Award Winner: 'I Really Feel Like We're Underdogs'

In &#x201C;Avengers: Doomsday,&#x201D; Stewart reprises his &#x201C;X-Men&#x201D; character Charles Xavier for the ninth and final time; even before his passing, EW notes that Stewart was offered a role in the film&#x2019;s sequel, &#x201C;Avengers: Secret Wars,&#x201D; due out in Dec. 2027, but declined. &#x201C;It was in the back of all of our heads, we may never see him on set again,&#x201D; Anthony said, describing the atmosphere as &#x201C;very emotional.&#x201D;

Anthony continued: &#x201C;It was clear that he was struggling with his health, and he worked so hard to deliver a performance and a presence &#x2014; for us as directors, for his other actors, for the crew. You could see it wasn&#x2019;t just the effort of a regular actor showing up and delivering that kind of presence and performance and experience for others, collaboration. It was someone who was really being challenged in a very deep way on a health level, showing up and doing that. For him to have muscled through and delivered the performance that he did in that movie, and the experience that he delivered for all of us as collaborators, it made it intensely emotional.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Stewart died after a brief battle with Alzheimer&#x2019;s and Lewy Body Dementia on Oct. 29, and both Feige and the Russo brothers are currently planning how best to pay tribute to the actor in the forthcoming film. &#x201C;We&#x2019;re long done filming that movie, and he did an amazing job for us,&#x201D; he said. &#x201C;We&#x2019;re looking now at how we can put something together that honors and respects our friend.&#x201D;

&#x201C;In a lot of ways, Xavier&#x2019;s the conscience in the movie,&#x201D; said Joe. &#x201C;He has a lovely scene with Ian McKellen, who&#x2019;s his best friend, in the film. It&#x2019;s a very emotional scene about forgiveness, and I think very resonant in the wake of his passing.&#x201D;

&#x201C;Avengers: Doomsday&#x201D; hits theaters on Dec. 18.

The 100th celebration of the Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade in New York City is finding itself at the mercy of the weather gods. It's made it through rain and even snow, but this time it's facing an incoming storm that is threatening to bring heavy winds. If things get too windy, the iconic balloons could be grounded.

This would mark the first time since 1971 that the balloons would be grounded. Related Stories 'Jimmy' Review: Cornball James Stewart Biopic Gets the Manner, but Not the Man ‘Best Pancakes in the County’ Review: Nicolas Cage Stars in a Thriller You Could Fairly Describe as Tarantino Lite

